@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@token = replace-with-a-valid-access-token

### List active assignments (user summary never includes credentials)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/asignaciones-rol
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Assign/reactivate a role for a user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/asignaciones-rol
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 2,
  "role_id": 1
}

### Duplicate active assignment returns 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/asignaciones-rol
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 2,
  "role_id": 1
}

### Inspect assignment
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/asignaciones-rol/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Revoke without deleting assignment history
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/asignaciones-rol/1/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reactivate assignment
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/asignaciones-rol/1/reactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
